OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to set London's highest   
OL,4,Alittering fines                        
OL,6,FPeople caught littering or illegally   
OL,7,Fdumping waste in a north-west London   
OL,8,Fborough are set to face higher fines as
OL,9,Fthe council steps up its efforts to    
OL,10,Ftackle persistent fly-tipping.         
OL,12,FHarrow Council has approved plans to   
OL,13,Fincrease penalties for littering,      
OL,14,Fbreaches of Public Space Protection    
OL,15,FOrders (PSPOs) and the most serious    
OL,16,Ffly-tipping offences.                  
OL,18,FPenalties for littering will rise from 
OL,19,F#500 to #750, with a reduced penalty of
OL,20,F#300 available for early payment - the 
OL,21,Fhighest to be introduced in the capital
OL,22,Funder a new national maximum cap.      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
