OL,3,GNEWSACouncil to set London's highest   
OL,4,Alittering fines                        
OL,6,FThe penalty for breaching a PSPO will  
OL,7,Fincrease from #100 to #500, while a new
OL,8,F#5,000 penalty will be introduced for  
OL,9,Fthe most serious fly-tipping offences. 
